  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Purple poison fog fills the grassland and grows denser with depth until it shows a clear light purple color.",
      "chapters": [
        427
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dark clouds cover it all year round under dusky light.",
      "chapters": [
        428
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "From the edge looking back, dark clouds, dusky sunlight, and gloomy cold wind still cover the place, with dark purplish poisonous grass bent into many shapes on corrupted land.",
      "chapters": [
        437
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan arrives here as Ge Yao flees poison beard wolves while searching for spirea. She warns that the deeper one goes, the more dangerous it becomes, and that purple poison fog poisons those who breathe it for long, growing denser with depth until ghosts and spirits appear and direction is hard to keep.",
      "chapters": [
        426
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_ge_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration states the grassland is covered with dark clouds all year round.",
      "chapters": [
        428
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its deepest part is a forbidden area for living beings, where wild beasts grow stronger and explorers, including rank three peak stage and rank four experts, fail to return.",
      "chapters": [
        429
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration places Zi Du Blessed Land in the deepest part, home of rank seven Gu Immortal Zi Yan Ran, titled Lady Poison Scorpion. Toxic gas released from that land forms purple poison fog over the grassland, and low-rung creatures sneak out with it, including large numbers of poison beard wolves. After a long cycle of that release, dark clouds cover the surroundings all year, purple fog lingers, poisonous grass grows, and mortals name the forbidden zone the poisonous grassland out of fear. Fang Yuan’s position at that time is around the center.",
      "chapters": [
        433
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "center-and-naming",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_zi_du_blessed_land",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_lady_poison_scorpion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From the edge looking back, poison grassland is still covered with dark clouds, dusky sunlight, and gloomy cold wind, with dark purplish poisonous grass bent into many shapes on corrupted land. Fang Yuan notes that if dense clouds over Hu Immortal Blessed Land’s eastern area are not dealt with, that land would develop in the same direction.",
      "chapters": [
        437
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "view-from-the-edge",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    }
  ],
